**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Build/CI noise
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/node_modules/
**/TestResults/

# Logs and local data — must not leak into the image
**/maribot-*.log
**/*.log
**/data.db
**/data.db-log
**/yahoo-auth.json

# Stray build outputs next to a csproj collide with the ones `dotnet publish`
# generates (NETSDK1152), so keep them out of the build context entirely.
**/*.deps.json
**/*.runtimeconfig.json
**/*.staticwebassets.endpoints.json

# Docker artefacts
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# Repo content not needed by the build
docs/
src/
README.md
LICENSE.txt
upgrade-assistant.clef

# Worker — explicitly excluded; Core has no dependency on it.
MariBot.Worker/
MariBot-Worker.Tests/
